---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="About · SqueekBlockNFT" current="/about">
<div class="max-w-2xl mx-auto px-4 py-12">
  <h1 class="text-amber text-2xl font-bold mb-2">About</h1>
  <p class="text-muted text-sm mb-6">SqueekBlockNFT is a community-made collection of SqueekChain block data cards. It is not affiliated with SqueekChain.</p>


  <div class="space-y-6 text-sm">
    <div class="term-box p-5">
      <h2 class="text-green font-bold mb-2">What is SqueekChain?</h2>
      <p class="text-muted">SqueekChain is a hamster-powered proof-of-work toychain on Ethereum Sepolia testnet. A hamster named Squeektoshi runs on the WHEELY9000 wheel. Each magnet passage is one work unit, settled to Ethereum as Squeek blocks, issuing SQK tokens.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="term-box p-5">
      <h2 class="text-green font-bold mb-2">What is a Block Data Card?</h2>
      <p class="text-muted">Each SqueekBlockNFT represents one block on SqueekChain. The card displays on-chain data: block number, round, work units, and rarity. It's a verifiable record of the hamster's work.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="term-box p-5">
      <h2 class="text-green font-bold mb-2">Rarity Tiers</h2>
      <div class="space-y-2 text-muted">
        <div><span class="text-amber font-bold">Legendary</span> · Blocks #1-#10</div>
        <div><span class="text-text font-bold" style="color:var(--color-epic)">Epic</span> · Blocks #11-#100</div>
        <div><span class="text-text font-bold" style="color:var(--color-rare)">Rare</span> · Blocks #101-#1,000</div>
        <div><span class="text-green font-bold">Milestone</span> · Every 1,000th block</div>
        <div><span class="text-green font-bold">Notable</span> · Every 100th block</div>
        <div><span class="text-muted">Common</span> · Everything else</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="term-box p-5">
      <h2 class="text-green font-bold mb-2">How to Mint</h2>
      <ol class="text-muted space-y-1 ps-4 list-decimal">
        <li>Connect your browser wallet, then switch to Sepolia when prompted</li>
        <li>Get testnet ETH from a <a href="https://sepolia-faucet.pk910.de/" class="text-green underline">Sepolia faucet</a></li>
        <li>Pick any block #1-#10,000 that has been mined</li>
        <li>Select Mint and confirm in your wallet. Your card appears after the transaction confirms</li>
      </ol>
    </div>

    <div class="term-box p-5">
      <h2 class="text-green font-bold mb-2">Contract</h2>
      <p class="text-muted">Deployed on Sepolia testnet. All art is generated fully on-chain via SVG. Card metadata and SVG art are stored on-chain. This community website is a separate static export for IPFS.</p>
      <p class="mt-2"><a href="https://sepolia.etherscan.io/address/0x531497ddc70d634342020b1111C8b1A92873e669" class="text-green underline break-address">0x531497ddc70d634342020b1111C8b1A92873e669</a></p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
</Layout>
